  "description": "Bring cozy autumn charm to your creative projects with this collection of 15 maple-inspired diagonal stripe seamless patterns. Featuring warm seasonal colors inspired by changing maple leaves, this collection is perfect for fall, harvest, Thanksgiving, rustic, and cozy-season designs. The repeating diagonal stripe format works beautifully for digital papers, scrapbook backgrounds, stationery, invitations, fabric, packaging, wallpapers, and seasonal crafts.\n✨What’s Included:\n•15 seamless patterns\n•Format: JPEG\n•Size: 3600 × 3600 px\n•High-resolution digital files\n✨Perfect for:\n•Autumn and fall-themed designs\n•Cozy season projects\n•Thanksgiving stationery and invitations\n•Fall scrapbook pages\n•Pumpkin patch and harvest designs\n•Rustic and farmhouse aesthetics\n•Cottagecore-inspired creations\n•Warm seasonal branding\n•Greeting cards and printable stationery\n•Fabric and textile projects\n•Digital scrapbooking\n•Journaling and planner decorations\n•Fall party decorations\n•Seasonal packaging and gift wrap\n•DIY crafts and creative projects",
